        "Batch05 preserves 134–139/printed 132–137 as fourth immutable native: independent part III title, main buying-guide prose through conclusion 138 and six model profiles. Sixty exact regions, 50 blocks, seven original images, three internal joins, six photo/title associations and 42 independent specification fields retained. 53 initial recognitions and one changed-crop repair precede one source correction pass; 52 unchanged drafts reused, zero unchanged-input retries. Historical values and printed errors including 3.25-inch/FTN/model 20 and independent profile/prose values retained. Twenty-four feature pages preserved; 140–147 and complete assembly pending.",
        "Batch06 preserves PDF 140–145/printed 138–143 as a fifth immutable native: four final profiles, 28 exact specification fields, complete display/keyboard comparison panels and twenty caption occurrences. All 62 exact regions, 36 blocks, 24 original photos, 24 photo/title-or-caption associations and two column joins are retained. Thirty-eight initial recognitions precede one source correction pass, with zero retries. GW-BAIC, 680/600×480, DC-8140, sysLIT286, independent key-count variants and explicit small-glyph/DP-like uncertainties remain source-linked. Thirty feature pages preserved; 146–147 and complete assembly pending.",
        "Batch07 preserves PDF 146–147/printed 144–145 as a sixth immutable native: eight tests, ten plotted series, ten legend entries, 99 printed decimal labels, 40 axis labels and one explicit source-absent third slot in test 2. The NP-902 bar/value is absent in the source; no number is invented. All 53 exact regions, 44 blocks, nine original chart/legend images and nine title/legend associations are retained. Forty-four initial recognitions precede one paused/resumed source correction pass, with zero retries. All 32 feature pages preserved; complete assembly pending. Printed legend clocks and 80286/8086/8088 prose variants remain literal.",
        "Batch08 completes the actual six-native assembly of canonical feature 0001 PDF 116–147: 325 regions, 217 blocks, 72 original images and 253 regional text occurrences. All 1,140 files independently exact; all 1,132 embedded native files and their complete original metadata remain unchanged. The source-proved 127 슬립 +128 모드 join is applied with the intervening sidebar intact. All 4,265 current ranges, 70 specification fields, 100 benchmark slots/99 visible values, source gaps and glyph candidates validate. All 325 crops match original scan pixels; 253 settings, seven ZIPs and three invalid-input guards pass. No new OCR/correction or reader rebuild. Canonical reference 124 remains unchanged; human/full-proofreading/glyph/technical limits remain explicit."
