      "classification_evidence": [
        "Matching original title/deck/three-part outline on PDF 198 and part I on 199 establish canonical 0002 ownership. Source title uses 데이타; canonical 데이터/reference 196 remains unchanged. PDF 198 has no visible folio and stays null; PDF 199–203 retain literal folios 197–201. Advertisement 197 precedes the title; closing prose/ornament/supplier table on 217 ends the feature before advertisements 218–219.",
        "Six-page opening 198–203 preserved as an immutable partial native: 59 exact regions, 41 blocks, eleven original images, three outline rows, five prose join groups, six application associations and eleven listed cases. All 48 initial drafts were read before one source correction pass, with zero retries. Patterned title, two blank blue captions and watermark-obscured prose on 201 were corrected directly from retained scans. Original barcode/bitmap glyphs and historical/technical claims remain unverified.",
        "Current market prose on 203 ends 비롯한; the left column on 205 resumes 자동인식 시스템 시장은 across the full-page POS sidebar on 204. The explicit future join is pending the next native; no source prose is discarded. Remaining 204–217 and complete assembly remain pending; eight interior pages remain uninspected.",
        "Batch 10 preserves PDF 204–209/printed 202–207 as the second immutable native: 78 regions, 50 blocks, seventeen original images, eight prose join groups and fourteen caption associations. Both intrinsic sidebars, eight numbered diagrams, fourteen label regions, six compact table cells and the original/linearized PCR formula remain source-linked. All 61 initial drafts read before one correction pass, zero retries. The interrupted 203/205 market join is attested in both native download contexts across complete POS sidebar 204. Original strat character, M row, formula order, arithmetic and physical English wraps remain literal; glyph/barcode decoding and technical claims remain unverified. Twelve feature pages preserved; remaining 210–217 and full assembly pending. Current 209 파 continues on 210 장의 with an empty separator."
